This package is a port of the `codemode` package from pi
(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), pinned at commit
8eb2bccf2603c28907ef3a583a04cafb1af284ae. Upstream license: MIT (see LICENSE).

Provenance: this is a fork-and-adapt port, not a clean-room reimplementation.
The upstream sources were read directly and their structure, naming and
algorithms were carried across; the changes are the adaptations to this
repository's runtime and module layout, summarized below and listed per file.

Adaptations, in order of how widely they apply:

  1. Every source and test file: relative specifiers no longer carry a `.ts`
     suffix, as this repository's `check-ts-relative-imports` invariant requires.
  2. Test runner: the three test files import `describe`/`it`/`expect`/`afterEach`
     from `bun:test` instead of `vitest`, and the package's `test` script is
     `bun test --parallel`. The upstream suite uses only five matchers
     (`toBe`, `toEqual`, `toContain`, `toMatch`, `toMatchObject`), none of which
     is vitest-specific, and it never touches `vi`. The vitest-specific
     `vitest.config.ts` is therefore not carried over.
  3. Package metadata: `package.json` follows this repository's package
     conventions — `@oh-my-pi/pi-codemode` in the `@oh-my-pi` scope, `catalog:`
     devDependencies, `oxlint`/`oxfmt`/`tsgo` scripts, `main`/`types`/`exports`
     pointing at `./src` rather than a build `dist`, and the repository's own
     author, repository, bugs and homepage fields.
  4. Formatting: oxfmt is the only formatter here, so arrow-function bodies are
     parenthesized and other upstream layout differences are normalized.
  5. `tsconfig.json` extends this repository's `packages/tsconfig.workspace.json`;
     upstream's `tsconfig.build.json` is not carried over, because this
     repository's packages publish from source rather than from a build output.

No behavioral change was made to the runtime. `src/` is otherwise byte-identical
to upstream modulo adaptations 1 and 4.

Adapted files:
  src/declarations.ts
  src/identifier.ts
  src/index.ts
  src/runtime/host.ts
  src/runtime/prelude-source.ts
  src/runtime/protocol.ts
  src/runtime/worker.ts
  src/source.ts
  src/types.ts
  src/wasm.ts
  test/declarations.test.ts
  test/sandbox.test.ts
  test/source.test.ts

Not carried over:
  vitest.config.ts        (adaptation 2)
  tsconfig.build.json     (adaptation 5)
  CHANGELOG.md            (replaced with this repository's changelog format)